67
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:55,620
Mrs. Brown and Hamilton.

68
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:56,240
Sir?

69
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,940
Mr. Northup, these two gentlemen

70
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:01,240
