71
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,880
and I was just this very moment saying

72
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:06,780
Solomon Northup is an expert player on the violin.

73
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,580
He was indeed.

74
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,260
Mr. Moon is being overly gracious.

75
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:11,760
Well, take it into consideration his graciousness.

76
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,500
Your modesty may we trouble you

77
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,240
for a moment of your time to converse, sir?

78
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,180
Of course.

79
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:17,720
Good.

80
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,560
A circus?

81
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:22,960
That is our usual employee, the company currently in the city of Washington.

82
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:27,360
Suck is too constricting a word to describe the talented and merry band with which we travel.

83
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:30,360
It is a spectacle unlike most have ever witnessed.

84
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:34,160
Creatures from the darkest Africa get unseen by civilized men,

85
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:39,160
acrobats from the Orient who contort themselves in the most confounding manners.

86
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:44,560
And I myself, in aid of Mr. Brown, an internationally renowned practitioner in the art of prestidigitation.

87
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,560
We are on our way thither to rejoin the company,

88
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:49,680
having left for a short time to make a small profit from our own exhibition.

89
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:51,600
The reason for our inquiry with Mr. Moody.

90
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:55,400
Yes, we had just a devil of a time in procuring music for entertainments.

91
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:57,860
Men of true talents are seemingly in short supply.

92
00:09:57,940 --> 00:09:58,940
Thank you, sir.

93
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,040
If we could persuade you...

94
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,960
to accompany us as far as Washington.

95
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,540
We could give you $1 for each day's services

96
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:07,040
and $3 for every night played at our performances.

97
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:09,060
In addition, we will provide sufficient pay

98
00:10:09,140 --> 00:10:12,140
for your return here to Saratoga two weeks from today.

99
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,680
Welcome to Washington, Solomon.

100
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:23,980
Today?

101
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,440
I didn't go too much!

102
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,440
Some say not enough.

103
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:35,440
Solomon, $43 all to you.

104
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:38,440
That is far more than my wages amounted.

105
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,440
It's been a most profitable week.

106
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,440
Cheers.

107
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,440
