126
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:39,360
Let him sleep, Hamilton.

127
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,200
A good night's rest.

128
00:12:43,540 --> 00:12:45,260
And tomorrow...

129
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:49,040
Tomorrow you will feel as well and refreshed

130
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:50,400
