132
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,620
Such is the pity.

133
00:12:57,440 --> 00:13:08,680
Well, boy, how you feel now?

134
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,820
My name...

135
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:15,160
My name is Solomon Northam.

136
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:19,220
I'm a free man, a resident of Saratoga, New York,

137
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:21,760
