138
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,100
And you have no right whatsoever to detain me.

139
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,600
You're not any free man.

140
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:28,860
And I promise you, I promise you upon my liberation,

141
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,900
