171
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,640
Oh, that's from my wife.

172
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,160
Oh, rags and tatters.

173
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:26,760
Rags and tatters.

174
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:38,960
Go on, wash up.

175
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:43,100
The boy, too.

176
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:43,780
