180
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:52,860
Mama.

181
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:53,760
Mama.

182
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:53,960
Quiet.

183
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:55,320
Quiet.

184
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:55,820
Mama.

185
