I swear she will, but you must be silent.

190
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:02,320
Be silent.

191
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:13,480
We need a sympathetic ear, an opportunity

192
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,860
