193
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:16,860
Who, in your estimation, is that sympathetic ear?

194
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:18,880
The two men I journeyed with.

195
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,960
I'm certain they're making inquiries at this very moment.

196
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,220
I'll be just as certain they're counting

197
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,880
