210
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:56,140
John's just being held as dead, that's all.

211
00:18:56,140 --> 00:18:58,140
Master P, it's doesn't John be redeemed.

212
00:18:58,140 --> 00:18:59,740
Boy, our masters will not come for us.

213
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,180
John, John, I'm sorry for your help,

214
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:02,520
