216
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:06,820
Mama!

217
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,580
Brian.

218
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:09,480
Mama!

219
00:19:11,820 --> 00:19:12,820
Are you all right?

220
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:22,860
Come on, get up.

221
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:23,660
