222
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,640
No, no, don't.

223
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,000
No, I don't want to hear you talk.

224
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:26,900
Get in the yard.

225
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:27,800
Not my children.

226
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,320
