229
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,260
ride, do you?

230
00:19:35,260 --> 00:19:36,760
That's master's going to pay his debt.

231
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:37,660
Hurry up. Line up.

232
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,100
This master's going to pay his debt.

233
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,000
What?

234
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:40,900
Get up.

235
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:41,800
Get up.

236
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:49,060
I don't want to hear a word out of none of you.

237
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:49,960
Not a one.

238
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:25,980
I'm sorry.

239
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
Let's go.

240
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,000
All right, come on.

241
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:06,000
