1155
01:30:40,060 --> 01:30:42,200
within his mind to be unaffected

1156
01:30:43,780 --> 01:30:46,780
or he finds some way to trample his guilty sensations.

1157
01:30:48,040 --> 01:30:50,860
I trampled with frequency.

1158
01:30:53,220 --> 01:30:55,820
I gave in to tales of wealth and prosperity,

1159
