But such profitable outcomes are reserved for plantation masters.

1160
01:31:02,820 --> 01:31:06,820
It's the lot of the rest of us to serve.

1161
01:31:06,820 --> 01:31:13,820
Now all I want is to earn a decent wage and get myself home.

1162
01:31:25,820 --> 01:31:48,880
The proceeds of my fiddling performances.

1163
01:31:48,880 --> 01:31:51,120
Just a few picayunes.

1164
01:31:52,020 --> 01:31:53,520
But all I have in the world,

1165
01:31:53,520 --> 01:31:58,160
