1173
01:32:23,520 --> 01:32:28,520
A patron is what I require, sir.

1174
01:32:34,520 --> 01:32:36,520
I'll do it.

1175
01:32:36,520 --> 01:32:39,520
And I'll accept whatever payment's offered.

1176
01:32:41,520 --> 01:32:44,520
To assist you, I put my own self at risk.

1177
01:32:44,520 --> 01:32:46,520
