I offer you the opportunity to speak on it.

1279
01:42:39,760 --> 01:42:46,560
Well, you asked plainly, so I will tell you plainly.

1280
01:42:47,500 --> 01:42:51,720
What amused me just then was your concern for my well-being in this heat,

1281
01:42:52,140 --> 01:42:55,120
when, quite frankly, the condition of your laborers...

1282
01:42:55,120 --> 01:42:55,940
The condition of my laborers?

1283
01:42:55,940 --> 01:42:56,760
It is horrid.

1284
01:42:57,060 --> 01:42:57,560
The hell?

1285
01:42:57,640 --> 01:42:59,800
It's all wrong. All wrong, Mr. Epps.

1286
01:43:00,020 --> 01:43:01,080
They ain't hired help.

1287
01:43:02,220 --> 01:43:03,140
They're my property.

1288
01:43:04,000 --> 01:43:05,400
You say that with pride.

1289
01:43:05,440 --> 01:43:06,240
I say it as fact.

1290
01:43:06,240 --> 01:43:12,180
If this conversation concerns what is factual and what is not,

1291
01:43:13,020 --> 01:43:17,640
then it must be said that there is no justice, no righteousness in this slavery.

1292
01:43:18,500 --> 01:43:20,640
But you do open up an interesting question.

1293
01:43:21,740 --> 01:43:25,000
What right have you to your niggers when you come down to the point?

1294
01:43:25,480 --> 01:43:25,960
What right?

1295
01:43:27,060 --> 01:43:29,760
I bought them. I paid for them.

1296
01:43:30,540 --> 01:43:33,540
Of course you did, and the law says you have the right to hold a nigger.

1297
01:43:33,540 --> 01:43:36,040
But begging the law's pardon, it lies.

1298
01:43:36,040 --> 01:43:39,040
Suppose they pass a law, taking away your liberty,

1299
01:43:39,040 --> 01:43:40,540
making you a slave.

1300
01:43:40,540 --> 01:43:42,040
Suppose.

1301
01:43:42,040 --> 01:43:44,040
That ain't a supposable case.

1302
01:43:44,040 --> 01:43:45,540
Laws change, Epps.

1303
01:43:45,540 --> 01:43:47,540
Universal truths are constant.

1304
01:43:47,540 --> 01:43:50,540
It is a fact, a plain and simple fact,

1305
01:43:50,540 --> 01:43:53,540
that what is true and right is true and right for all.

1306
01:43:53,540 --> 01:43:55,540
White and black alike.

1307
01:43:57,540 --> 01:43:59,540
You compare me to a nigger, Bass?

1308
01:43:59,540 --> 01:44:03,040
I'm only asking in the eyes of God, what is the difference?

1309
01:44:03,040 --> 01:44:08,640
Might as well ask what the difference is between a white man and a baboon.

1310
01:44:10,560 --> 01:44:15,200
I seen one of them critters in Orleans know just as much as any nigger I got.

1311
01:44:16,160 --> 01:44:19,280
Listen, Epps, these niggers are human beings.

1312
01:44:19,760 --> 01:44:21,960
If they are allowed to climb no higher than brood animals,

1313
01:44:22,340 --> 01:44:24,460
